  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new Menu doesn't allow rejoining the same instance. I don't understand this decision to restrict this.\nThe old Main menu did let you join the same instance, which did make sense.\nWhy was this useful?\nExample 1: I use Wireless. And if my headset disconnects i can't hear people anymore. I need to rejoin the instance so i can hear them again. But here comes the annoyance with the new menu. I need to go to my home world and either request or search the person i was just with again.\nExample 2:\nThere some worlds that just break or lag after a while. So you rejoin. No, no new instance. Just rejoin and it's fixed.\nThe Main menu should not give the message: \"Can't join cause you are already in this instance\", but instead just let you rejoin like before.",
